---
// Hero Section with solid black typography, grey highlights, and green action buttons
---

<section class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 to-white pt-12 pb-16 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-24 border-b border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      
      <!-- Grey Highlight Badge -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-100 border border-slate-300 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 shadow-sm mb-6">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#16A34A] animate-pulse"></span>
        <span>RKMIDIGILABS • AI Governance, Cybersecurity & Executive Academy</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Headline - Bold Black Fonts -->
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-black tracking-tight leading-[1.15] sm:leading-[1.15]">
        Enterprise <span class="text-[#112649] underline decoration-[#16A34A] decoration-4 underline-offset-8">AI Governance</span>, Risk & Regulatory Compliance
      </h1>

      <!-- Subheading - Crisp Dark Typography -->
      <p class="mt-6 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto font-normal">
        <strong>RKMIDIGILABS</strong> translates complex AI legislation and security standards into actionable, audit-ready roadmaps. Providing advisory, team training, and executive certification tracks on the <strong>EU AI Act</strong>, <strong>NIST AI RMF</strong>, and <strong>ISO/IEC 42001</strong>.
      </p>

      <!-- Buttons with Green and Navy Corporate Colors -->
      <div class="mt-8 sm:mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3.5">
        <a 
          href="/courses" 
          class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-bold text-sm bg-[#16A34A] hover:bg-[#15803D] text-white shadow-md flex items-center gap-2 transition-all"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-none stroke-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"/></svg>
          <span>Explore Courses & Academy</span>
        </a>
        <a 
          href="/specialised-training" 
          class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-bold text-sm bg-[#112649] hover:bg-[#1d3d75] text-white shadow-sm flex items-center gap-2 transition-all"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-none stroke-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
          <span>Specialised AI Training</span>
        </a>
        <a 
          href="/company-profile" 
          class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-bold text-sm bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-800 border border-slate-300 shadow-sm flex items-center gap-2 transition-all"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-none stroke-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/></svg>
          <span>Company Profile & Deck</span>
        </a>
        <a 
          href="/blog" 
          class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-bold text-sm bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 border border-slate-300 shadow-sm flex items-center gap-2 transition-all"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-600 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
          <span>Blog & Dispatches</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Framework Highlight Pills in Grey -->
      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-slate-200 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 text-xs font-mono text-slate-600">
        <a href="/frameworks#eu-ai-act" class="bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 px-3 py-1 rounded border border-slate-300 font-semibold transition-colors">
          EU AI Act (Annex III)
        </a>
        <a href="/frameworks#nist-ai-rmf" class="bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 px-3 py-1 rounded border border-slate-300 font-semibold transition-colors">
          NIST AI RMF 1.0
        </a>
        <a href="/frameworks#iso-42001" class="bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 px-3 py-1 rounded border border-slate-300 font-semibold transition-colors">
          ISO/IEC 42001 AIMS
        </a>
        <a href="/frameworks#iso-27001" class="bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 px-3 py-1 rounded border border-slate-300 font-semibold transition-colors">
          ISO 27001 & SOC 2
        </a>
        <a href="/specialised-training#tracks" class="bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 hover:bg-emerald-100 px-3 py-1 rounded border border-emerald-300 font-bold transition-colors">
          OWASP LLM Red-Teaming
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
